is not cryptographic provider/compiler authorship. C26/P08 controller/release remain open.\"\n  ],\n  \"outcome\": \"Actual independent current G10 review audited. Historical G7/C29 evidence and C30/C41 owner decisions remain explicitly distinguished.\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
