th a configured tenant open no internet socket from the app or its WebKit processes (a fact added to C44-N01; C24-N03 self-run asserts the same)\"),\n    # ---- C02 tenants and Settings → the wizard (C43), the shared setup and the carried-over facts (C44) ----\n    \"C02-N01\": (X, [\"C43-N01\", \"C44-N01\"], \"the wizard's tenant form creates the tenant; every driver's setup creates its tenant through Settings' form and makes it active before the destinations open\"),\n    \"C02-N02\": (X, [\"C43-N01\", \"C44-N01\"], \"the scan key card saves the key (Required); no plaintext secret in any destination's tree\"),\n    \"C02-N03\": (P, [\"C44-N01\"], \"after a quit and relaunch the tenant is active with its client and key (Administration reads again), no wizard shows (a fact added to C44-N01)\"),\n    \"C02-N04\": (R, [], \"the session-only storage mode: crates/desktop-core/tests (the vault's session mode) and the Settings page's radios; no v2 driver saves a session-only key\"),\n    \"C02-N05\": (R, [], \"the reviewed endpoint override is the Settings page's: crates/desktop-core/tests (tenant endpoint review); the v2 drivers create tenants on their custom endpoint directly\"),\n    \"C02-N06\": (R, [], \"the airs-cli profile import is retired by D060 (no import from the alpha; its removal is the follow-up chunk's)\"),\n    \"C02-N07\": (R, [], \"a locked credential store: crates/desktop-core/tests (the vault's locked state); the fixture-only keychain lock menu is not driven by the v2 drivers\"),\n    \"C02-N08\": (S, [\"C04-N12\"], \"Reset local data removes the tenants, the preference document and every fixture-namespace Keychain item: asserted by acceptance_c04.py's reset step on the one presentation (the first run returns)\"),\n    \"C02-N09\": (R, [], \"corrupt local data reported and recovered by Reset: crates/desktop-core/tests/ui_v2_shell and the store's tests\"),\n    \"C02-N10\": (X, [\"C43-N03\", \"C35-N02\"], \"Tab reaches the tenant step's fields and the 