4-N06 | Signing out shows 'Not signed in to Academy', empties the learner Keychain namespace and revokes the refresh token at the issuer. | self-run | C04-N06 — acceptance_c04.py through legacy_v2 (Settings' Academy account group is the same page in the v2 frame) | C04-N06 pass |\n| C04-N07 | A sign-in declined in the browser shows 'Sign-in was declined in the browser.' with 'Sign in again', and saves nothing. | self-run | C04-N07 — acceptance_c04.py through legacy_v2 (Settings' Academy account group is the same page in the v2 frame) | C04-N07 pass |\n| C04-N08 | With the Academy endpoint unreachable, sign-in reports that Academy could not be reached, and nothing is saved. | self-run | C04-N08 — acceptance_c04.py through legacy_v2 (Settings' Academy account group is the same page in the v2 frame) | C04-N08 pass |\n| C04-N09 | Cancelling a sign-in that is waiting for approval returns to 'Not signed in to Academy'; a grant issued afterwards does not sign in and nothing is saved. | self-run | C04-N09 — acceptance_c04.py through legacy_v2 (Settings' Academy account group is the same page in the v2 frame) | C04-N09 pass |\n| C04-N10 | Keyboard only: Tab reaches 'Sign in to Academy', Space starts sign-in, Tab reaches 'Open sign-in page' and 'Cancel sign-in'; state changes are exposed through a live s… | self-run | C04-N10 — acceptance_c04.py through legacy_v2 (Settings' Academy account group is the same page in the v2 frame) | C04-N10 pass |\n| C04-N11 | At 200% zoom and at the minimum window size, the Academy sign-in control is reachable by Tab and lies inside the window clear of the bottom fade. | self-run | C04-N11 — acceptance_c04.py through legacy_v2 (Settings' Academy account group is the same page in the v2 frame) | C04-N11 pass |\n| C04-N12 | Reset local data signs the Academy account out and empties the learner Keychain namespace. | self-run | C04-N12 — acceptance_c04.py through legacy_v2 (Settings' Academy account group is the same page in the v2 frame) | C04-N1